Q: WAP to print HAlf Pyramid using *:
package half_pyramid;

public class Half_pyramid {

   
    public static void main(String[] args) {
      //Outer loop
        for(int i=1;i<=5;i++){
      //Inner loop
            for(int j=1;j<=i;j++){
                System.out.print("*");
            }
            System.out.println();
            
        }
        
    }
    
}
OUTPUT:

*
**
***
****
*****

